  <note xmi:id="_6Nci1MmCEfClDv2KOrT7rQ" opaque="true" posX="32" posY="192" sizeHeight="161" sizeWidth="609" text="To run that sample you need to&#xA;&#x9;- Export and deploy DemoService (from Integration perspective) to &#xA;&#x9;   Talend ESB runtime.&#xA;&#x9;- Make sure demo service is running in Runtime, check URL&#xA;&#x9;   http://localhost:8040/services/DemoService?WSDL&#xA;&#xA;To test how route works just go with your browser to following URL:&#xA;&#x9;http://localhost:8088/demo?param=Hello"/>
